WEBVTT

NOTE
The Ragnarok in atmospheric flight through storm clouds.
Duration: approximately 25 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Trailing orange fire, the Ragnarok tears through the sky.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:09.370
It climbs steeply through banks of sunset storm clouds.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.740
The shot fades out.
